Package: ndpi-observe
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libbpf0 | libbpf1, libndpi4 | libndpi-dev, iproute2
Recommends: prometheus, grafana
Description: TC eBPF + nDPI traffic classifier daemon
 ndpi-observe classifies network traffic by application using TC eBPF and the
 nDPI library. After an initial classification (first ~8 packets), all
 subsequent packets are counted entirely in-kernel via BPF PERCPU_ARRAY —
 zero userspace copies. Exposes per-application metrics via Prometheus.
 .
 Includes ndpid (daemon) and ndpictl (CLI).
